cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DUET: two-part hurdle testing for single-cell differential expression in Python"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pachinger-Molnár"
    given-names: "Bence"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pahi95/duet"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - differential expression
  - hurdle model
  - MAST
  - pseudoreplication
  - Python
  - scverse
abstract: >-
  DUET provides two-part hurdle testing and donor-level pseudobulk analysis for
  single-cell RNA sequencing in Python, with underflow-safe log-scale significance.
  The repository includes the analysis scripts behind the accompanying manuscript.
